// Inputs that reach bb 6.0.0's multiplications unblinded with a collision
// (blind.nr, k1_emul.nr): K1_COLLIDE_EQ, _DBL and _NEG have keys solved so
// that a ladder step of the unblinded secp256k1 multiplication meets
// A = P, 2A + P = O or A = -P (K1_COLLIDE_CTL is a shifted control that
// does not); K1_RINF_A and _B have R = u1 G + u2 Q at infinity with u2's
// trailing digits arranged so the last ladder step meets 2A + P = O
// (K1_RINF_CTL, the same construction, does not); K1_RG_VALID is a valid
// signature with R = G whose unblinded run meets 2A + P = O in the last
// round; R1_M4INV_H has key -(1/4) H and R1_KEY_H key H, for bb's
// secp256r1 offset generator H. Generated with Python models of the
// gadgets; all but the controls fail bb prove when they reach the black
// box directly.
